@startuml
title 002 搶答活動 — 時序圖（逐題開放）
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "老師" as T
participant "TeacherConsolePage" as TP
participant "學生端\n（第 2 組）" as P2
participant "學生端\n（第 5 組）" as P5
participant "SessionGateway" as GW
participant "CommandQueue" as Q
participant "ActivityService" as AS
participant "QuestionTimer" as QT
participant "BuzzEngine" as BE
participant "RankingPolicy" as RP
participant "Broadcaster" as BC
participant "ResultsService\n（003）" as RS

== 開放下一題（第 n 題，R3、R11） ==
T -> TP : 按「開放第 n 題」
TP -> GW : teacher:openNext（連線帶老師憑證）
GW -> GW : 確認是老師（REQ-BUZ-02）
GW -> Q : enqueue(OpenNextQuestion)
Q -> AS : openNextQuestion()
AS -> AS : 第 n 題 = OPEN\ndeadline = now + 每題秒數（有設定時）
AS -> QT : start(n, deadline)
AS ->> BC : notify（非同步）
BC -->> TP : view:teacher（第 n 題開放中、remainingSec）
BC -->> P2 : view:student（第 n 題題目與倒數，只含本組資料）
BC -->> P5 : view:student（同上）

== 兩組幾乎同時送出第 n 題（時序正確 R10、NFR-01～03） ==
P2 -> GW : student:submit(submissionId=a1, 第 n 題, 答案)
P5 -> GW : student:submit(submissionId=b7, 第 n 題, 答案)
GW -> Q : enqueue(Submit a1)
GW -> Q : enqueue(Submit b7)
note over Q
  依抵達順序逐一處理，一筆完成前不會處理下一筆。
  臨界區只做驗證、取序號、寫入紀錄，不做網路傳送
end note
group 臨界區（a1）
  Q -> AS : submit(a1)
  AS -> BE : submit(activity, a1)
  BE -> BE : 檢查：第 n 題開放中、本組未送過、\n小題填齊、非空白、≤ 200 字
  BE -> BE : seq = takeNextSeq()\nreceivedAt = SequenceClock.stamp()
  BE --> AS : ACCEPTED
end
group 臨界區（b7）
  Q -> AS : submit(b7)
  AS -> BE : submit(activity, b7)
  BE -> BE : seq = takeNextSeq()\nreceivedAt ≥ a1.receivedAt
  BE --> AS : ACCEPTED
end
AS ->> BC : reply / notify（在臨界區之外）
BC -->> P2 : ack SubmitResult ACCEPTED（不含順位）
BC -->> P5 : ack SubmitResult ACCEPTED（不含順位）
BC -->> TP : view:teacher（第 2 組 #1、第 5 組 #2）\n大量送出時每 200 ms 合併一次，落後 ≤ 1 秒

== 第 n 題結束（倒數歸零或老師手動） ==
alt 倒數歸零
  QT -> Q : enqueue(CloseQuestion(TIMEOUT))
else 老師按「結束這一題」
  T -> TP : 結束這一題
  TP -> GW : teacher:closeQuestion
  GW -> Q : enqueue(CloseQuestion(TEACHER))
end
Q -> AS : closeQuestion(reason)
AS -> QT : cancel()
AS -> RP : resolve(第 n 題, 該題送出, 各組已搶到題數)
RP --> AS : QuestionResult（純函式：同一份紀錄永遠得到同樣結果）
AS -> AS : 第 n 題 = CLOSED，保存結果
AS ->> RS : onQuestionClosed(activity, result)\n（非同步，寫入本機紀錄檔）
AS ->> BC : notify
BC -->> TP : view:teacher（第 n 題已結束 + 完整順位）
BC -->> P2 : view:student（第 n 題成功組別與答案）
BC -->> P5 : view:student（同上）

P5 -> GW : student:submit(submissionId=b9, 第 n 題)（結束後才抵達）
GW -> Q : enqueue(Submit b9)
Q -> AS : submit(b9)
AS -> BE : submit(activity, b9)
BE --> AS : REJECTED（這一題已結束，不取序號）
AS ->> BC : reply
BC -->> P5 : ack SubmitResult REJECTED（QUESTION_NOT_OPEN）

== 最後一題結束後：結束活動 ==
T -> TP : 結束活動
TP -> GW : teacher:endActivity(confirm)
GW -> Q : enqueue(EndActivity)
Q -> AS : endActivity()
AS -> AS : phase = ENDED，未開放的題目記為無人搶答
AS ->> RS : onActivityEnded(activity)
AS ->> BC : notify
BC -->> TP : view:teacher（phase = ENDED，前往結果與匯出）
BC -->> P2 : view:student（phase = ENDED，前往完整結果）
BC -->> P5 : view:student（同上）
@enduml
